{
    "title": "SPYPOINT",
    "description": "THE ENTIRE HUNT IN THE PALM OF YOUR HAND  \r\n\r\nThe SPYPOINT app allows you to receive high-quality photos and videos from your SPYPOINT cellular trail camera directly to your smartphone or tablet. It also provides a simple and easy way to:  \r\n\r\n- Activate new cameras  \r\n\r\n- Save photos and videos \r\n\r\n- View customizable maps and weather information  \r\n\r\n- Check the status of your cameras, including signal strength, battery level and storage space  \r\n\r\n- Manage multiple cameras \r\n\r\n- Share camera feeds with other users\r\n\r\n- Change camera settings or update firmware remotely*  \r\n\r\n- Set and control notifications  \r\n\r\n- Request on-demand photos or video from cameras with Instant Mode* \r\n\r\n- Quickly sort and filter photos using species tags that are automatically applied with BUCK TRACKER\u2122 AI technology.  \r\n\r\n*FLEX series only, refer to model specifications for more details.\r\n\r\n\r\nA TRANSMISSION PLAN FOR EVERYONE \r\n\r\nEach camera requires a transmission plan to receive images from the field. SPYPOINT provides a FREE transmission plan option of 100 photos per month, per camera. To receive more photos or videos, upgrade your transmission plan.  \r\n\r\nTHE SPYPOINT INSIDERS CLUB  \r\n\r\nIf you take next-level scouting seriously, sign up for the SPYPOINT Insiders Club and enjoy an array of benefits such as: \r\n\r\n- A FREE basic transmission plan (250 photos per month)  \r\n\r\n- 20% off photo transmission plans \r\n\r\n- 20% off all accessories  \r\n\r\n- 50 FREE full-HD photos per year \r\n\r\n- 20% off full-HD photo and video packages  \r\n\r\n- FULL ACCESS to all eight BUCK TRACKER\u2122 AI species filters\r\n\r\n- Camera sharing to your feed of photos and videos  \r\n\r\n- 500 photos or videos to save in your own favorites filter \r\n\r\n- 12 months of transmitted photo and video history \r\n\r\n- Monthly giveaways of special SPYPOINT bundles and other hunting equipment \r\n\r\n- A dedicated support team to expedite service calls",
    "descriptionHTML": "THE ENTIRE HUNT IN THE PALM OF YOUR HAND  <br><br>The SPYPOINT app allows you to receive high-quality photos and videos from your SPYPOINT cellular trail camera directly to your smartphone or tablet. It also provides a simple and easy way to:  <br><br>- Activate new cameras  <br><br>- Save photos and videos <br><br>- View customizable maps and weather information  <br><br>- Check the status of your cameras, including signal strength, battery level and storage space  <br><br>- Manage multiple cameras <br><br>- Share camera feeds with other users<br><br>- Change camera settings or update firmware remotely*  <br><br>- Set and control notifications  <br><br>- Request on-demand photos or video from cameras with Instant Mode* <br><br>- Quickly sort and filter photos using species tags that are automatically applied with BUCK TRACKER\u2122 AI technology.  <br><br>*FLEX series only, refer to model specifications for more details.<br><br><br>A TRANSMISSION PLAN FOR EVERYONE <br><br>Each camera requires a transmission plan to receive images from the field. SPYPOINT provides a FREE transmission plan option of 100 photos per month, per camera. To receive more photos or videos, upgrade your transmission plan.  <br><br>THE SPYPOINT INSIDERS CLUB  <br><br>If you take next-level scouting seriously, sign up for the SPYPOINT Insiders Club and enjoy an array of benefits such as: <br><br>- A FREE basic transmission plan (250 photos per month)  <br><br>- 20% off photo transmission plans <br><br>- 20% off all accessories  <br><br>- 50 FREE full-HD photos per year <br><br>- 20% off full-HD photo and video packages  <br><br>- FULL ACCESS to all eight BUCK TRACKER\u2122 AI species filters<br><br>- Camera sharing to your feed of photos and videos  <br><br>- 500 photos or videos to save in your own favorites filter <br><br>- 12 months of transmitted photo and video history <br><br>- Monthly giveaways of special SPYPOINT bundles and other hunting equipment <br><br>- A d